raye-apps (1.0~beta1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * New Clock app: alarms that ring with the window closed, with days, sound
    and Snooze, timers, a stopwatch with laps and world clocks.
  * New Graphics Card panel: live readings of the graphics card, and on AMD
    Radeon cards the performance mode, workload profile, power limit and a
    fan curve, kept across restarts. NVIDIA cards open the NVIDIA Control
    Panel, now named so in Start.
  * Task Manager: the mouse wheel scrolls the lists by a Windows-sized step.

